            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a12.d06.reading.b2",
          "en": "This is my sister. Her name is Kate. Her room is next to the kitchen.",
          "ru": "Это моя сестра. Её зовут Кейт. Её комната рядом с кухней.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/a12.d06.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a12.d06.reading.b3",
          "en": "There is some food on the table. Our cat is under the chair. We are happy here together.",
          "ru": "На столе есть еда. Наш кот под стулом. Мы счастливы здесь вместе.",
          "audio": {
